20
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,300
残念？もういないのに
A disappointment? Even though she's no longer here...

21
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:44,200
あれ？そっちが喰いアイロニー
Huh? What an irony that it's consuming me,

22
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:47,300
蝕まれてるのは今の自分なのに
even though it's my present self that's being eaten away.

23
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:50,800
消えないレッテル 要はコンプレックス
An indelible label—in short, a complex.

24
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:54,400
取り憑かれてるみたい 巻き付いたまま
It's like I'm possessed, tightly coiled around me,

25
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:58,900
まだ離れない 在りし日の自分
still unable to let go of who I used to be.

26
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:00,400
UNDEAD

27
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:03,200
死んじゃいない お前とお前の連鎖
You're not dead—a chain reaction between you and yourself.

28
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:07,000
生きていることとは変わり続けることだ
To be alive is to keep changing.

29
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,900
不幸に甘んじて満足するなよ Satisfaction
Don't settle for misfortune and call it satisfaction!

30
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:13,800
幸せになろうとしないなんて 窮屈だ
Not even trying to find happiness is just suffocating.

31
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:17,300
この世この世は奇怪奇怪ファンタジー
This world, this world is a bizarre, strange fantasy.

32
00:01:17,300 --> 00:01:20,500
次は鬼が出るか蛇が出るか
Will a demon or a serpent appear next?

33
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:24,000
出逢って遭ってやっと始まる物語
A story that finally begins when we meet and encounter fate.

34
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:27,400
さあ人か化け物か 顔文字かいピースピース
Come now, human or monster? Or just an emoticon? Peace, peace!

35
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:30,300
Past & future... can't change the past...

36
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:33,300
Past & future... run for the future...

37
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:35,300
カットイン 何だかどうして
Cut in—why does it feel like...

38
00:01:35,300 --> 00:01:40,200
未来になんぞ何の希望もない 期待も出来ないような気がして
...there's no hope or expectation whatsoever for the future?

39
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:44,200
もう随分生きてる既視感とテンプレで食傷
Having lived so long, I'm sick of the déjà vu and clichés,

40
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:47,400
素敵な出来事の気配もない
